messages:
Celeste: Heads-up — BigRetail asks for a short POC: live SDK stream, server-side function callbacks that POST structured order JSON to their webhook. Main asks: auth type, recommended backpressure strategy, telemetry/trace headers, and a rough price for ~500 req/s for 2-week trial. Any quick checklist? @ravi @marco
Ravi: Sounds doable. Quick Q: 500 req/s sustained or bursty? Do they want websocket/SSE or long-lived gRPC streams?
Celeste: Mostly sustained with spikes to ~1k for short windows. They prefer websocket for client simplicity; could do SSE if needed.
Marco: SDK supports websocket + HTTP chunking. For function callbacks we emit a `func_call` envelope — webhook should ack fast (200) and process async. Example payload below:
```json
{
  "type": "func_call",
  "id": "call_123",
  "name": "create_order",
  "payload": {
    "order_id": "ORD-001",
    "items": [{"sku": "ABC", "qty": 2}]
  },
  "trace_id": "tx_789"
}
```
Marco: Recommended pattern: webhook ack 200 immediately, then process. On 5xx/timeout we retry with exponential backoff; make webhooks idempotent using `order_id` + `call_id`.
Ravi: For backpressure at 500 rps, enable client-side batching (we support batch_size=8) and server batching TTL=25ms. Also enable prefix/KV caching if prompts repeat — reduces token cost.
Priya: Pricing note — we can run on trial credits for the demo. Ballpark: at 500 req/s with avg 120 input tokens + 60 output tokens, hosted cost estimate ~ $X/day (need exact calc from finance). I'll assemble a clean estimate for the client.
OpsBot: Canary env provisioned: `canary-3` (8xA10G). Ingress qps cap set to 2k. Console: https://console.redwood/canary-3
Ben-Legal: Quick flag — if their webhook payload includes PII we need the SOC2 appendix signed and double-check retention policy. I'll send our minimal security questionnaire now.
Celeste: Action items: (1) Marco drop webhook example + retry headers, (2) Ravi share batching config + SDK sample, (3) Priya draft pricing ballpark, (4) Ben-Legal send security questionnaire. Kickoff call Wed 10am PT — invite incoming :thumbsup:
Marco: Pushing a JS example (ws client) — minimal pattern:
```js
const client = new RedwoodWS({ apiKey: process.env.RW_KEY });
client.on('func_call', async (msg) => {
  // ack immediately
  client.ack(msg.id);
  // forward payload to customer webhook
  await fetch(process.env.WEBHOOK, { method: "POST", body: JSON.stringify(msg.payload) });
});
client.connect();
```
Ravi: Also ensure `X-Trace-Id` is passed through and recommend handling `Retry-After` on 429s.
Celeste: Thanks all — will send calendar invite. Any blockers before Wed?
Priya: Need legal to confirm SOC2 timeline; otherwise looks good to proceed.
